    y: 226.5
    width: 190
    height: 135
  IsDragging: 1
  IsSelected: 0
  _sentence:
    CharacterName: Sebastian
    Text: No there is not. If there was, I would not tell you. Dark times are about
      to befall the Kingdom and if you want to come out of them unscathed I suggest
      you keep your nose out of this and let the Church decide what is best.
    CharacterSprite: {fileID: -6322953688314822395, guid: c9583b64e73bdd1478a84d540701a034, type: 3}
  ParentNodes:
